### Create todo
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express",
  "description": "Practice CRUD API",
  "state": "todo"
}

###

### Get all todos
GET http://localhost:3000/todos

###

### Get todos by state
GET http://localhost:3000/todos?state=doing

###

### Get one todo
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/ca67b15e-2f4c-493e-8a0a-395e34d9480b

###

### Update todo
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/ca67b15e-2f4c-493e-8a0a-395e34d9480b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express",
  "description": "Updated",
  "state": "done"
}

###

### Delete todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/ca67b15e-2f4c-493e-8a0a-395e34d9480b

###

### Invalid state
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test",
  "state": "invalid"
}

###

### Todo not found
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/12345

###

### Delete nonexistent todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/12345